<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>rose at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was unchanged at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>				  November 21 fix     November 20 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.02 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.05 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.32 pct		3.31 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.43 pct		3.42 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
